<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "The root of all terms in the Hearing Impairment Ontology, an effort to unambiguously describe all concepts and unifying up-to-date knowledge in hearing impairment." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HIO" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000077> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An agent, event, condition or characteristic which plays an essential role in producing an occurrence of disease." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000077> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000077> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Disease Cause" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000077> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000079> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000079> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A characteristic of a disease." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000079> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000079> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Disease Attribute" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000079> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000001> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000082> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A cause of disease that is (at least initially) external to the organism. This includes exposure to a toxic or infectious agent, physical factors in the environment, or an event that causes injury." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000082> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000082> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Environmental Disease Cause" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000082> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000077> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000093> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Damage inflicted on the body as the direct or indirect result of an external force, with or without disruption of structural continuity." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000093> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Native BioPortal hierarchy: HIO" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000093> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000093> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Injury" .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000093> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HIO_0000082> .
